# Dawn of Death (abyssea 162), the reply kind: a level 99 Warrior in Port Jeuno with the quest accepted, its story
# quests before it, 3 maw quests and the three set quests completed (GMs: their offers would tie). Joachim: 333,
# finished: completed, First Contact accepted. First Contact back to available and the quest back to accepted (GMs):
# Joachim again: 333 again. Joachim has his own onTrigger (xi.abyssea.traverserNPCOnTrigger): an Event-rank 333 would
# alternate with it (interaction_lookup.lua's UseFallback) and the second talk would go to his script (his 328: Dawn of
# Death accepted or completed).
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onEventFinish/333
char zone=PortJeuno pos=-51.344,0,-9.978 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.TheTruthBeckons completed
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath accepted
quest Abyssea.AGoldstruckGigas completed
quest Abyssea.ToPasteAPeiste completed
quest Abyssea.MegadrileMenace completed
quest Abyssea.HeroesOfAbyssea completed
quest Abyssea.ScarsOfAbyssea completed
quest Abyssea.TheForbiddenFrontier completed
login
trigger Joachim                         # 333
finish                                  # completed; First Contact accepted
quest Abyssea.FirstContact available    # a GM
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath available     # a GM
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath accepted      # a GM
trigger Joachim                         # 333 again (the kind)
finish                                  # completed again
